### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 78/100.** Evidence TB ~70%; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 76/100.** Evidence GPQA ~75%; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 72/100.** 128K total — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 60/100.** Text in/out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 78/100.** Evidence SWE ~60%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 55/100.** Paid ~$3/$10 per 1M.
- **Overall Score: 73/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (78+76+72+60+78)/5=72.8 → 73; best-fit per scoring methodology.

